#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:1
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "优化"

#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:3
msgid ""
"Mean-variance objectives, risk parity and efficient-frontier construction "
"with diagnostics."
msgstr "均值-方差目标、风险平价以及带诊断信息的有效前沿构建。"

#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../guides/portfolio-risk.md) for task-oriented "
"examples. Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same"
" commit as the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的示例参见[使用指南](../guides/portfolio-risk.md)。以下签名由与本站点其余内容同一提交的公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:7
msgid "Efficient-frontier points and endpoint portfolios."
msgstr "有效前沿点与端点组合。"

#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:7 ../../site/api/optimization.md:10
#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:13 ../../site/api/optimization.md:16
#: ../../site/api/optimization.md:19 ../../site/api/optimization.md:22
